  comment   = {ExpertAF generates coach-like actionable feedback from a learner video + 3D pose: (i) free-form expert commentary and (ii) a corrective expert demonstration via retrieval and corrected pose generation. It constructs weak supervision from Ego-Exo4D by using an LLM to clean/compress ASR expert commentary into concise feedback, label body regions and improvement vs. correct execution, mine novice--expert pairs using skill-level metadata, and temporally align/filter pairs with PA-MPJPE, yielding (learner, feedback, expert-correction) training tuples.}
}

