  tags     = {Dataset, FineDiving+ (new)},
  comment  = {This work is an extended journal version of \cite{xu2022finediving}. Main extensions: (1) extends TSA to STSA by adding the Spatial Motion Attention (SMA) module with proxy-task implicit supervision to learn foreground human-centric attention, improving interpretability and discriminability; (2) adds more in-depth analyses, detailed ablations, and visualizations (SMA and procedure-aware cross-attention), plus evaluations on additional datasets showing SMA’s effect; (3) expands FineDiving to FineDiving+ (adds ~1/3 more samples) and builds three new transfer/generalization benchmarks: across competitions, synchronized vs. individual dives, and springboard vs. platform dives (unknown scenarios/rules/types/difficulty).}
}

