  modality = {RGB},
  project  = {},
  tags     = {Semi-Supervised AQA},
  comment  = {This work proposes SAP-Net for semi-supervised AQA with a teacher--student architecture: the teacher performs actor-centric region detection and generates high-confidence pseudo-labels, while a self-supervised sub-action parsing module discovers fine-grained sub-action sequences and their temporal dependencies (without predefined sub-action classes). It further introduces group contrastive learning with pseudo-labels to align motion-oriented representations between teacher and student, achieving strong results on MTL-AQA, FineDiving, Rhythmic Gymnastics, and FineFS.}
}

